# Compiled Dynamic libraries
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
# ...except the prebuilt assimp runtime that FbxMeshSplitter's postbuild copies next to the .lib files
# committed beside them. The blanket *.dll above is why those DLLs were never in the repository, which
# is why that copy failed on every Windows build. The .lib halves of the same pair ARE committed.
!Editor/ThirdParty/assimp/bin/Debug/*.dll
!Editor/ThirdParty/assimp/bin/Release/*.dll

